<title>USA: FAC Realty to declare Q3 div with meeting.</title>
<headline>FAC Realty to declare Q3 div with meeting.</headline>
<dateline>SMITHFIELD, N.C. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAC Realty Trust Inc said on Friday it will declare a third quarter dividend in conjunction with its scheduled meeting on October 17.</p>
<p>The company also said third quarter results will be announced on October 30 1996.</p>
<p>FAC Realty Trust, headquartered in Smithfield, North Carolina, is a self-administered real estate investment trust engaged in the management, leasing, marketing, development and acquisition of outlet shopping centers.</p>
